{"seq":1,"slug":"charge-basis-definition-scope","title":"计费基数定义与口径：GMV、成交价、运费、税费与折扣的入账范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/charge-basis-rate-card-engine/charge-basis-definition-scope","wordCount":2911,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"计费基数定义与口径-gmv-成交价-运费-税费与折扣的入账范围\">计费基数定义与口径：GMV、成交价、运费、税费与折扣的入账范围</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>计费基数（charge basis）是「把哪些钱算进这个费率的作用范围」。同一个 12% 的佣金率，作用在「商品单价」上和作用在「商品单价 + 运费 + 礼盒费」上，收出来的钱可以差 15% 以上——而双方的费率卡、合同、账单看起来都写着 12%。因此平台计费引擎的第一个工程决策不是费率数值，而是基数口径：<strong>哪些订单金额字段进入基数、按什么顺序加减、以什么币种与精度表达</strong>。</p>\n<p>Amazon 的公开定价页把口径写得最直白：referral fee 对一个商品的「总价」计收，而这个总价 &quot;includes its list price, as well as shipping costs and any gift-wrapping charges&quot;（来源：Amazon Selling，<a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/pricing）。Walmart\">https://sell.amazon.com/pricing）。Walmart</a> 的表述几乎同构：&quot;Total sales price includes item price as well as shipping and handling, gift wrap and other charges&quot;（来源：Walmart Marketplace 定价页，<a href=\"https://marketplace.walmart.com/pricing/）。两家的共同点是：**运费与礼盒费进基数，税率口径不公开承诺**。这就是口径分歧的起点。\">https://marketplace.walmart.com/pricing/）。两家的共同点是：**运费与礼盒费进基数，税率口径不公开承诺**。这就是口径分歧的起点。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单行金额 line total] --&gt; B{基数构造}&#10;  C[运费 shipping] --&gt; B&#10;  D[礼盒/包装 gift wrap] --&gt; B&#10;  E[手续费 handling] --&gt; B&#10;  F[税费 tax / VAT / GST] --&gt; B&#10;  G[折扣 discount] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; H[计费基数 B]&#10;  H --&gt; I[佣金 = max&amp;#40;B × 费率, 最低费&amp;#41;]&#10;  H --&gt; J[支付处理费基数]&#10;  H --&gt; K[账单行 amount]&#10;  F -.口径差异.-&gt; L[是否进基数?]&#10;  G -.口径差异.-&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[订单行金额 line total] --&gt; B{基数构造}\n  C[运费 shipping] --&gt; B\n  D[礼盒/包装 gift wrap] --&gt; B\n  E[手续费 handling] --&gt; B\n  F[税费 tax / VAT / GST] --&gt; B\n  G[折扣 discount] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; H[计费基数 B]\n  H --&gt; I[佣金 = max&amp;#40;B × 费率, 最低费&amp;#41;]\n  H --&gt; J[支付处理费基数]\n  H --&gt; K[账单行 amount]\n  F -.口径差异.-&gt; L[是否进基数?]\n  G -.口径差异.-&gt; L</pre><p>下表汇总 2026 年主流平台公开的口径差异，是建模时的对照基准。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>基数名称</th>\n<th>商品价</th>\n<th>运费</th>\n<th>礼盒/包装</th>\n<th>税</th>\n<th>最低费/固定费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>referral fee</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>未公开承诺</td>\n<td>多数类目 $0.30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Walmart</td>\n<td>referral fee</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>未公开承诺</td>\n<td>未公开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBay</td>\n<td>final value fee</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>有条件含</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>含（销售税）</td>\n<td>≤<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 4: 10 \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">10 \\</span></span>0.30 / &gt;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 4: 10 \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">10 \\</span></span>0.40</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopify</td>\n<td>third-party transaction fee</td>\n<td>订单总额</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>无固定费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：Amazon <a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/pricing；Walmart\">https://sell.amazon.com/pricing；Walmart</a> <a href=\"https://marketplace.walmart.com/pricing/；eBay\">https://marketplace.walmart.com/pricing/；eBay</a> 卖家费用帮助（Fees &amp; Billing）；Shopify <a href=\"https://www.shopify.com/pricing。费率区间同样直接决定基数弹性：Amazon\">https://www.shopify.com/pricing。费率区间同样直接决定基数弹性：Amazon</a> 的类目费率横跨 3%–45%，多数落在 8%–17%；Walmart 为 3%–20%；eBay 为 0.5%–15.3%，并叠加跨境 1.65% 与国际结算 3%（美国注册卖家，2026-10-14 起升至 3.25%）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订单金额的构成与可计费字段\">订单金额的构成与可计费字段</h2><p>基数不是订单的一个字段，而是一个从订单行聚合出来的<strong>派生量</strong>。工程上先要有一份权威的订单金额账（amount ledger），把每一类钱拆成独立字段，再让费率卡声明它读哪些字段。</p>\n<p>一条订单的金额可以写成如下形式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行的单价与数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为买家承担的运费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为礼盒包装费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 为处理费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为税额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>seller</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{seller}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为卖家出资的折扣：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>seller</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = \\sum_i p_i q_i + S + W + H - D_{\\text{seller}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子里的每一项都是<strong>口径开关</strong>，而不是常数。Amazon 与 Walmart 的口径相当于把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 全部并入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>；若某平台声明税不进基数，则把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 中排除。引擎必须让每个开关由费率卡显式声明，缺省值取「不进基数」（保守侧），而不是取「进基数」——把不该收的钱多发出去比少收更难追回。</p>\n<p>几个必须区分的字段语义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>成交价（item price）</strong> 是加折扣前的挂牌单价，不是实付价。折扣是单独的负向字段，不能直接把乘积改成折后价，否则折扣归因和促销结算就丢了依据。</li>\n<li><strong>运费（shipping）</strong> 有三种贴上来的方式：卖家自定运费、平台代收运费、平台补贴运费。只有买家实付、进入卖家结算的那部分才进基数；平台补贴部分不进，否则等于对补贴再收一次佣金。</li>\n<li><strong>税（tax/VAT/GST）</strong> 是最容易错的一项。EU 电子商务增值税方案自 2021-07-01 起，对 150 欧元以下的进口商品远程销售，市场平台在法定情形下成为<strong>视同供应商（deemed supplier）</strong>，由平台承担增值税申报义务（来源：European Commission, VAT e-commerce package）。既然税是平台自己的负债而非卖家的销售收入，把它计入「对卖家收入计征的佣金基数」在法理上站不住——这正是多数平台选择排除或不承诺的工程原因。</li>\n<li><strong>礼盒/包装与处理费</strong> 在 Amazon、Walmart、eBay 三家的公开口径里都进基数。它们金额小但逐笔存在，不建模会在月末对账时集中暴露为「小额多笔」差异。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"运费与税费的口径分歧\">运费与税费的口径分歧</h2><p>运费进基数还有一个反直觉后果：卖家提高运费也会被收佣金。若卖家为覆盖高运费商品（大件、偏远地区）而把运费设为成本价，佣金会把它再抬一层，形成「运费越高、佣金越高」的正反馈，最终迫使卖家把成本折回商品价里——口径设计由此直接塑造市场行为，这也是平台在几类商品上做例外的原因：eBay 对运费设置了例外，某些情况下按最便宜的本土配送选项计，或在国际配送、免费配送与球鞋鉴定场景下不计运费。</p>\n<p>税费口径还叠加<strong>征管主体</strong>问题。美国自 <em>South Dakota v. Wayfair</em>（2018）之后，各州可对无实体存在但超过经济联结（economic nexus）阈值的卖家要求代收代缴销售税；随后各州陆续通过<strong>市场促成者法（marketplace facilitator laws）</strong>，把代收代缴义务转移给平台（来源：Streamlined Sales Tax Governing Board，<a href=\"https://www.streamlinedsalestax.org/）。这意味着平台同时扮演两个角色：对卖家是收佣金的服务方，对税局是代收代缴的义务方。两套账的基数必须物理隔离——把平台代收的税计入佣金基数，等于拿平台自己代收的税款去计征卖家佣金，审计上无法自洽。\">https://www.streamlinedsalestax.org/）。这意味着平台同时扮演两个角色：对卖家是收佣金的服务方，对税局是代收代缴的义务方。两套账的基数必须物理隔离——把平台代收的税计入佣金基数，等于拿平台自己代收的税款去计征卖家佣金，审计上无法自洽。</a></p>\n<p>工程结论：<strong>税字段不能与收入字段共用一条聚合路径</strong>。建议在订单模型里把金额分类为 <code>seller_revenue</code>（进基数候选）与 <code>platform_liability</code>（代收代缴，永不进基数）两个类别，由分类字段而非字段名来决定归属。这样新增一个国家、一口新税制时，只需给新税种打上 <code>platform_liability</code> 标签，不改计费逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>金额字段</th>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>是否可进基数</th>\n<th>变更成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品单价 × 数量</td>\n<td>seller_revenue</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家实付运费</td>\n<td>seller_revenue</td>\n<td>平台决定</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台补贴运费</td>\n<td>seller_revenue</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>礼盒/包装/处理费</td>\n<td>seller_revenue</td>\n<td>平台决定</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>销售税/VAT/GST</td>\n<td>platform_liability</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家出资折扣</td>\n<td>seller_revenue</td>\n<td>是（负向）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台出资折扣</td>\n<td>platform_liability</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货退款</td>\n<td>reversal</td>\n<td>是（负向冲销）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"折扣-优惠券与促销对基数的扣减顺序\">折扣、优惠券与促销对基数的扣减顺序</h2><p>折扣是该主题里最难对齐的一项，因为「折扣从基数里扣不扣」取决于<strong>谁出这笔钱</strong>，而不取决于折扣长什么样。核心规则是：<strong>卖家出资的折扣是卖家收入的减少，应扣减基数；平台出资的折扣是平台的营销成本，不应扣减基数</strong>。两者在结算单上都表现为「优惠」，但一个让平台少收佣金，另一个让平台照常收佣金外加自己贴钱。</p>\n<p>当折扣是订单级的（如满减）而计费是行级时，必须做<strong>按行金额比例分摊（proration）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i = D \\cdot \\frac{p_i q_i}{\\sum_j p_j q_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2294em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分摊后的行折扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与行金额一起进入该行的基数。这里有一个取整陷阱：按比例摊出来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常是无限小数，逐行取整后其和一般不等于订单级折扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>。若不处理，订单的佣金合计会与「用订单级基数直接计算」的结果差几分钱，在对账时被判定为差异。</p>\n<p>因此引擎需要一个**残差归位（residual allocation）**步骤：先逐行取整，再把</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = D - \\sum_i \\text{round}(d_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>的残差补到金额最大的一行（或按「最大化残差法」分配）。这条规则必须写死为确定性算法并随账单存证，否则同一笔订单在不同时间重算会得到不同的分币结果，导致「重算不平」。</p>\n<p>优惠叠加（stacking）的顺序同样影响基数。业界通行的做法是<strong>先按可用性排序，再按出资方分组</strong>：先应用卖家出资的定向券，再应用平台出资的优惠券，最后应用订单级满减。顺序不同会让平台出资部分是否落在卖家折扣之后而变化，从而改变最终基数。引擎应显式记录每一层的应用顺序与出资方，作为账单行的可审计字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计价单位-币种与取整\">计价单位、币种与取整</h2><p>一个费率卡的可复现性，最终落在这两个问题的答案上：<strong>用什么精度算，用哪种取整模式</strong>。</p>\n<p>金额绝不能用浮点数存储或计算。ISO 4217 为每种货币定义了 minor unit（小数位指数）：USD、EUR、GBP 为 2 位，JPY、KRW、CLP 为 0 位，BHD、KWD、OMR 为 3 位（来源：ISO 4217 货币代码表）。跨境平台同时服务这三类货币，所以金额在引擎内部应以<strong>最小单位（minor unit）的整数存储</strong>，把指数作为货币属性携带。</p>\n<p>取整模式同样要显式声明：四舍五入（half-up，面向消费者时的常见默认）、银行家舍入（half-even，减少统计偏差）、向下取整（floor，平台自保但易被投诉）。跨币种时还要决定<strong>取整发生的时点</strong>：先在原币种取整再换算，还是先换算再取整。两者的差额在高频小额订单上会累积成可观数目。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始计算值 高精度] --&gt; B{取整时点}&#10;  B --&gt;|先取整再换算| C[原币整数 minor unit]&#10;  B --&gt;|先换算再取整| D[目标币高精度]&#10;  C --&gt; E[换算到结算币]&#10;  E --&gt; F[再取整]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{残差处理}&#10;  G --&gt;|行级残差| H[归位到最大行]&#10;  G --&gt;|订单级残差| I[计入订单调整行]&#10;  H --&gt; J[账单行 可审计]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[原始计算值 高精度] --&gt; B{取整时点}\n  B --&gt;|先取整再换算| C[原币整数 minor unit]\n  B --&gt;|先换算再取整| D[目标币高精度]\n  C --&gt; E[换算到结算币]\n  E --&gt; F[再取整]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{残差处理}\n  G --&gt;|行级残差| H[归位到最大行]\n  G --&gt;|订单级残差| I[计入订单调整行]\n  H --&gt; J[账单行 可审计]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>实践中的推荐组合是：<strong>行级计算保留高精度 → 行级取整到目标币种最小单位 → 残差归位到最大金额行 → 订单级合计校验</strong>。这套顺序保证订单的佣金合计严格等于逐行佣金之和，从而「账单明细相加 = 账单汇总」这一恒等式永远成立。恒等式一旦成立，对账就退化为对「汇总行」的核对，而不是逐行重算。</p>\n<p>最后，币种换算率本身要作为<strong>计费输入的显式快照</strong>存进账单。若换算率在结算日与出账日之间变动，而账单只存了换算式的结果，卖家质疑时无法复现——这与折扣残差是同一类可复现性缺陷。汇率快照应带来源、时点、提供方三项元数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>基数是一组口径开关，不是一个字段</strong>。<code>B = Σpᵢqᵢ + S + W + H − D_seller</code>，每一项的进出都由费率卡显式声明，缺省取「不进基数」。</li>\n<li><strong>运费普遍进基数，税普遍被排除或不予承诺</strong>。三家公开口径都含运费与礼盒费；税因征管主体是平台本身（EU deemed supplier、US marketplace facilitator）而走 <code>platform_liability</code> 独立路径。</li>\n<li><strong>折扣按出资方决定去留</strong>。卖家出资扣减基数、平台出资不扣减；订单级折扣进基数前按行金额比例分摊并做残差归位。</li>\n<li><strong>精度用整数最小单位 + ISO 4217 指数建模</strong>。跨币种时先算高精度、行级取整、残差归位到最大行，使「明细之和 = 汇总」恒成立。</li>\n<li><strong>可复现性是审计要求</strong>：取整算法、折扣分摊顺序、汇率快照都必须随账单存证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>基数的取用顺序与费率卡的数据模型（费率选择、阶梯、最低费、类目映射）共同决定最终收费，展开见 <code>../2_fee-calculation-charge-engine/INDEX.md</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计费基数定义与口径：GMV、成交价、运费、税费与折扣的入账范围","id":"计费基数定义与口径-gmv-成交价-运费-税费与折扣的入账范围"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"订单金额的构成与可计费字段","id":"订单金额的构成与可计费字段"},{"level":2,"text":"运费与税费的口径分歧","id":"运费与税费的口径分歧"},{"level":2,"text":"折扣、优惠券与促销对基数的扣减顺序","id":"折扣-优惠券与促销对基数的扣减顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"计价单位、币种与取整","id":"计价单位-币种与取整"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"费率卡数据模型：费用类目层级、条件/阶梯费率与生效版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/charge-basis-rate-card-engine/rate-card-model-category-hierarchy"}}